#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax:1 of
msgid "Compute the row index of the maximum value in each group."
msgstr "计算每组最大值的行索引。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax:2 of
msgid "The index is the 0-based integer row position in the original frame."
msgstr "索引是原始帧中从 0 开始的整数行位置。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax:3 of
msgid ""
"Exclude NA/null values. If False, and any value is NA, the result is NA."
msgstr "排除 NA/null 值。如果为 False，且任何值为 NA，则结果为 NA。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax:4 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to :meth:`agg`."
msgstr "转发给 :meth:`agg` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax:5 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with one row per group and the per-group maximum-value "
"row indices.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"每个组有一行且包含每组最大值行索引的惰性 LiteFrame。调用 ``.execute()`` "
"来实例化。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.idxmax.rst
